            >
              Everything in one place
            </span>

        <h2
          class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl"
        >
          A simpler way to manage appointments
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          From business availability to customer reminders, SecureMySlot
          brings the complete booking journey into one straightforward
          platform.
        </p>
